  "text": "```verilog\nmodule areset_sync #(\n    parameter STAGES = 2\n)(\n    input  clk,\n    input  async_rst_i,\n    output sync_rst_o\n);\n\n    localparam N = (STAGES < 1) ? 1 : STAGES;\n\n    reg [N-1:0] sync_reg;\n\n    always @(posedge clk or posedge async_rst_i) begin\n        if (async_rst_i)\n            sync_reg <= {N{1'b1}};\n        else\n            sync_reg <= {sync_reg[N-2:0], 1'b0};\n    end\n\n    assign sync_rst_o = sync_reg[N-1];\n\nendmodule\n```<|im_end|>",
